Table full name: COVID19_USA.COVID19_VACCINATION_ACCESS.FACILITY_BOUNDARY_US_ALL
Column name: facility_sub_region_2 Type: TEXT Description: The name (or type) of a region in the country. Typically a subdivision of sub_region_1. For example, Santa Clara County or municipal_borough.
Column name: facility_sub_region_1_code Type: TEXT Description: A country-specific ISO 3166-2 code for the region. For example, US-CA.
Column name: facility_name Type: TEXT Description: The name of the vaccination site. For example, St. Joseph's Hospital.
Column name: facility_sub_region_2_code Type: TEXT Description: In the US, the FIPS code for a US county (or equivalent). For example, 06085.
